{"5019880":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hollow Warden","steam_appid":5019880,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is wrong in the ward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Detective Jonah, a seasoned investigator assigned to a brutal case inside Hollowmere Psychiatric Hospital. The building has been abandoned for years. The crime scene is fresh. And the deeper you go, the less anything makes sense.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras\/1971e1e46d2f7bc2c3622c33317177d7.avif?t=1793714387\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras_big\/1971e1e46d2f7bc2c3622c33317177d7.avif?t=1793714387 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Warden is a third-person psychological horror game where investigation is your only way forward. Explore the decaying halls of an abandoned psychiatric hospital, investigate crime scenes, gather evidence, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover the truth behind a case that should never have been reopened.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hospital has a way of getting inside your head.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As reality begins to fracture, every discovery pulls you deeper into a nightmare where memory, guilt, and madness become impossible to separate.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras\/fec5e720896f60bd89459329e937548b.avif?t=1793714387\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras_big\/fec5e720896f60bd89459329e937548b.avif?t=1793714387 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Investigate crime scenes and gather evidence as Detective Jonah.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Explore an abandoned psychiatric hospital filled with secrets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Solve environmental puzzles to uncover hidden paths and forgotten records.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Piece together a dark, story-driven mystery through documents, clues, and environmental storytelling.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Experience psychological horror built on atmosphere, tension, and uncertainty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras\/225854880bbccb5010d02d47db9f6350.avif?t=1793714387\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras_big\/225854880bbccb5010d02d47db9f6350.avif?t=1793714387 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detective follows the evidence.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what happens when the evidence leads somewhere the mind was never meant to go?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hollow Warden, the most disturbing thing you'll uncover isn't hidden within the hospital.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's what the hospital uncovers within you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is wrong in the ward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Detective Jonah, a seasoned investigator assigned to a brutal case inside Hollowmere Psychiatric Hospital. The building has been abandoned for years. The crime scene is fresh. And the deeper you go, the less anything makes sense.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras\/1971e1e46d2f7bc2c3622c33317177d7.avif?t=1793714387\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras_big\/1971e1e46d2f7bc2c3622c33317177d7.avif?t=1793714387 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Warden is a third-person psychological horror game where investigation is your only way forward. Explore the decaying halls of an abandoned psychiatric hospital, investigate crime scenes, gather evidence, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover the truth behind a case that should never have been reopened.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hospital has a way of getting inside your head.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As reality begins to fracture, every discovery pulls you deeper into a nightmare where memory, guilt, and madness become impossible to separate.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras\/fec5e720896f60bd89459329e937548b.avif?t=1793714387\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras_big\/fec5e720896f60bd89459329e937548b.avif?t=1793714387 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Investigate crime scenes and gather evidence as Detective Jonah.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Explore an abandoned psychiatric hospital filled with secrets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Solve environmental puzzles to uncover hidden paths and forgotten records.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Piece together a dark, story-driven mystery through documents, clues, and environmental storytelling.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Experience psychological horror built on atmosphere, tension, and uncertainty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras\/225854880bbccb5010d02d47db9f6350.avif?t=1793714387\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/extras_big\/225854880bbccb5010d02d47db9f6350.avif?t=1793714387 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detective follows the evidence.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what happens when the evidence leads somewhere the mind was never meant to go?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hollow Warden, the most disturbing thing you'll uncover isn't hidden within the hospital.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's what the hospital uncovers within you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Something is wrong in the ward. As a detective investigating a serious crime, navigate the ruins of an abandoned psychiatric hospital, gather evidence, and follow a trail that leads deeper into madness","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Arabic<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/af02c4c1d97c315e4180cce6148ae8f741975c2e\/header.jpg?t=1793714387","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/7c3e7e933a2378bcc64e3adc7f8448ab6a1eaf7a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793714387","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019880\/7c3e7e933a2378bcc64e3adc7f8448ab6a1eaf7a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793714387","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 1909 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 8GB<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB \/ AMD RX 580 8GB<br><\/li>