ironments designed to create a tense and oppressive atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe game also contains strong language in dialogue and written content. While there is no sexual content, the overall experience is intended for mature audiences due to its violent and graphic nature."},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"14","required_age":"14","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Violência\nMedo\nLinguagem imprópria"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"16","required_age":"16","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nAlkohol \/ Tabak\nSchimpfwörte"},"igrs":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"18","required_age":"18","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Horor\nKekerasan\nRokok dan\/atau rokok elektronik, minuman beralkohol, narkotika, psikotropika, dan\/atau zat adiktif lainnya"}}}}}